[25.68956, "o", "> "]
[25.689741, "o", "   - Extract the first role from the '\"'\"'roles'\"'\"' array as '\"'\"'primary_role'\"'\"' (if roles exist, otherwise null).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.689874, "o", "4. **Sort Users**: Sort the resulting users alphabetically by their '\"'\"'username'\"'\"' in ascending order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
